eudi_lib_cbor
Copyright (c) 2026 the eudi_lib_cbor contributors

This product is a Cangjie (仓颉) CBOR module for the EU Digital Identity
Wallet on HarmonyOS. It provides a CborValue facade shaped after the CBOR
model used by the EUDI Wallet Swift libraries, tag-24 helpers, and RFC 8949
bytewise canonical map ordering.

This product depends on the following third-party software:

  - cbor4cj (Apache License 2.0) — Cangjie CBOR engine from Cangjie-TPC
    (https://gitcode.com/Cangjie-TPC/cbor4cj), consumed as a cjpm git
    dependency from a fork carrying build-only fixes; the exact commit is
    pinned in eudi_cjcbor/cjpm.lock. Not vendored.

